    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72245" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴκ-ᾰδε</span></b>  (Delph. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝοίκαδε</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>GDI</u>
			2561
		</span></i><i><span class="en">
			<u>C</u>
			42
		</span></i>), Adv., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶκόνδε</span>
			, <i>to one's house, home,</i> or <i>country,
			homewards,</i> freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.170
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.176
			</span></i>, al. : freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				<u>N.</u>
				4.76
			</span></i>, al.), Trag. (as <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1337
			</span></i> (anap.)), Com. (as <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				618
			</span></i>), and 
				Att.
			 Prose (as <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				328b
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to people's houses,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Telecl.
				1.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴκοι</span>
			, <i>at home,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.3.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>An.</u>
				7.7.57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Dem.Enc.</u>
				26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				1.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phalar.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				143
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
